<title>USA: New Image Industries 1996 shr loss lower.</title>
<headline>New Image Industries 1996 shr loss lower.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, California 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Image Industries, Inc.</p>
<p>		   Summary Consolidated Statements Of Operations</p>
<p>	   For each of the years ended June 30,</p>
<p>						 1996		   1995</p>
<p> Net revenues		     $37,144,000	   $44,579,000</p>
<p> Costs of revenues		 24,400,000	    29,531,000</p>
<p>   Gross profit		    12,744,000	    15,048,000</p>
<p> Net loss			   (11,171,000)	  (11,850,000)</p>
<p> Net loss per share		    (2.05)		  (2.19)</p>
<p>Weighted average shares of</p>
<p>    common stock outstanding    5,449,000	     5,412,000</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 and 1995 results include impact of 1996 merger with Insight Imaging Systems Inc. They also include results of Insight. -- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
